OL,3,AVance says he will decide 'sometime
OL,4,Anext year' about 2028 US presidential
OL,5,Arun
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS Vice-President JD Vance has said he
OL,8,Fwill make a decision "sometime next
OL,9,Fyear" about whether or not he will run
OL,10,Ffor president in 2028.
OL,12,FIn an interview with Fox News, Vance
OL,13,Fwould not provide a timeline on making
OL,14,Fa determination, but signaled he is not
OL,15,Fin a hurry to make up his mind.
OL,17,F"I haven't made a decision. We'll
OL,18,Ffigure it out sometime next year,"
OL,19,FVance said. When pressed by host Laura
OL,20,FIngraham, he added: "When I make a
OL,21,Fdecision, I'll be all in on whatever
OL,22,Fthat decision is."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
