OL,3,AVance says he will decide 'sometime
OL,4,Anext year' about 2028 US presidential
OL,5,Arun
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe comments came amid growing interest
OL,8,Fin Vance's next moves in the weeks
OL,9,Fsince voters handed both President
OL,10,FDonald Trump and Republicans a
OL,11,Fresounding defeat in the midterm
OL,12,Felections.
